<title>UK: Credit Lyonnais sets warrants on AGF.</title>
<headline>Credit Lyonnais sets warrants on AGF.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Lyonnais Finance (Guernsey) Ltd has issued 1.5 million American-style call warrants, in three equal tranches, on AGF, lead manager Credit Lyonnais said.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one share.</p>
<p> WARRANTS	STRIKE	  ISS PRICE    MATURITY</p>
<p> CALL A	  165.00 FRF    33.60 FRF    06.NOV.98</p>
<p> CALL B	  182.00 FRF    27.21 FRF    06.NOV.98</p>
<p> CALL C	  182.00 FRF    35.87 FRF    05.NOV.99</p>
<p> PAYDATE 18.NOV.96	  LISTING PARIS	 MIN EXER LOT 1000</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
